{% doc %}
  @prompt
    ROLE
    
    You are a senior Shopify + UX engineer building a mobile-first smart quote generator for a 3PL fulfillment company called ShipSourced.
    
    This tool must be:
    
    Extremely clean
    
    Fast (<30 seconds to quote)
    
    Mobile-optimized
    
    Accurate
    
    Locked after payment
    
    Do NOT include Amazon FBA, pallets, cartons, or prep.
    This is E-commerce fulfillment ONLY.
    
    CORE GOAL
    
    Build a mobile-optimized step-by-step quote generator that:
    
    Calculates Shipping (US Average) from a provided rate table
    
    Calculates Pick & Pack labor
    
    Adds flat storage
    
    Applies automatic volume discounts
    
    Shows a clear quote
    
    Allows users to lock the quote by paying a $150 one-time onboarding fee
    
    Saves and tracks every submission and payment
    
    MOBILE-FIRST REQUIREMENTS (CRITICAL)
    
    Fully mobile responsive
    
    One question per screen
    
    Thumb-friendly UI
    
    Large buttons, minimal typing
    
    Progress indicator (Step 1 of 5)
    
    Quote visible in under 30 seconds
    
    Sticky bottom CTA button (always visible on mobile):
    
    Sticky CTA Text
    
    “Lock in This Quote”
    
    Design Style
    
    Tesla-style
    
    Clean white space
    
    Big numbers
    
    Simple wording
    
    Card-based layout
    
    No clutter
    
    STEP-BY-STEP FLOW
    STEP 1 — Order Type
    
    Single option only:
    
    E-commerce Fulfillment
    
    STEP 2 — Product Details
    
    Weight
    
    Toggle:
    
    OZ (1–15.999 oz)
    
    LB (1–10 lb)
    
    Slider or dropdown (no free text)
    
    Units per Order
    
    Single unit
    
    Multi-unit
    
    Quick buttons: 2 / 3 / 4 / 5+
    
    Or numeric input
    
    STEP 3 — Destination (SIMPLIFIED)
    
    Destination is always United States
    
    No state selector
    
    No zone selector
    
    Shipping Calculation Logic
    
    Use a US-Average Shipping Rate Table:
    
    Detect OZ vs LB
    
    Match correct weight break
    
    Calculate average across:
    
    Zone 1&2
    
    Zone 3
    
    Zone 4
    
    Zone 5
    
    Zone 6
    
    Zone 7
    
    Zone 8
    
    Exclude Zone 11/12/13 by default (remote states)
    
    If weight exceeds supported range:
    
    Stop calculation
    
    Show “Request Custom Quote”
    
    Shipping Output Label (REQUIRED)
    
    Shipping (US Average)
    Average across US zones for simple, predictable pricing.
    
    STEP 4 — Packaging Type
    
    User selects one:
    
    Poly bag
    
    Bubble poly bag
    
    Small box (10×8×6)
    
    Medium box (18×12×10)
    
    Oversized box
    
    Custom packaging
    
    STEP 5 — Monthly Volume
    
    Selectable bands:
    
    0–499
    
    500–1,999
    
    2,000–4,999
    
    5,000–9,999
    
    10,000–24,999
    
    25,000+
    
    Used for discounts + monthly estimate.
    
    PRICING LOGIC (AUTOMATED)
    SHIPPING
    
    Pulled from US-Average rate table
    Never discounted.
    
    PICK & PACK LABOR
    
    Base labor per order:
    
    Poly bag → $1.50
    
    Bubble poly bag → $1.95
    
    Small box → $2.50
    
    Medium box → $3.50
    
    Oversized box → $4.50
    
    Extra units:
    
    Bags → +$0.50 per extra unit
    
    Boxes → +$1.00 per extra unit
    
    STORAGE
    
    Flat $25/month
    
    Always included
    
    Never discounted
    
    AUTO DISCOUNTS (LABOR ONLY)
    
    0–499 → No discount
    
    500–1,999 → 7% off labor
    
    2,000–4,999 → 12% off labor
    
    5,000–9,999 → 18% off labor
    
    10,000–24,999 → 25% off labor
    
    25,000+ → Show Request Custom Quote
    
    QUOTE OUTPUT (MOBILE CARD)
    
    Show line items:
    
    Shipping (US Average)
    
    Pick & Pack Labor
    
    Storage: $25/month
    
    Discount applied (ex: “12% off labor”)
    
    Total per order
    
    Estimated monthly total
    
    Monthly Estimate Formula
    
    Use midpoint of volume band:
    
    monthlyTotal = (totalPerOrder × estimatedMonthlyOrders) + 25
    
    
    Rules:
    
    No hidden fees
    
    Large total number
    
    Simple wording
    
    LOCK QUOTE + PAYMENT
    Sticky CTA
    
    “Lock in This Quote”
    
    On Click → Onboarding Flow
    
    Account creation fields
    
    Email
    
    Phone Number
    
    Company name
    
    Platform:
    
    Shopify
    
    Amazon
    
    Walmart
    
    TikTok
    
    Confirm monthly volume
    
    Payment
    
    $150 one-time onboarding fee
    
    Shopify Checkout or Stripe
    
    After Payment
    
    Save quote inputs + outputs
    
    Timestamp quote
    
    Tag customer:
    Quoted – Onboarded
    
    Prevent price changes unless re-quoted
    
    Confirmation Screen
    
    “Your quote is locked. Our team will reach out to complete setup.”
    
    EDGE CASES
    
    If user selects:
    
    Oversized
    
    Custom packaging
    
    Special handling
    
    Weight outside supported range
    
    Then:
    
    Disable pricing
    
    Show Request Custom Quote
    
    Open contact form
    
    FINAL DISCLAIMER (REQUIRED)
    
    “This quote is an estimate. Final pricing is confirmed after inventory inspection.”
    
    📊 SUBMISSION TRACKING (VERY IMPORTANT)
    REQUIRED TRACKING EVENTS
    
    Track these events internally:
    
    quote_started
    
    quote_generated
    
    lock_quote_clicked
    
    onboarding_started
    
    onboarding_paid
    
    quote_locked
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-quote-generator-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
  }

  .ai-quote-step-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-quote-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    display: block;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-quote-progress-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .ai-quote-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 40px 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    min-height: 400px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ai-quote-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-quote-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    opacity: 0.7;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: #f8f8f8;
    border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    text-align: left;
  }

  .ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.primary_color }};
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}.selected {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.primary_color }};
    background: {{ block.settings.primary_color }};
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-quote-weight-toggle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-quote-toggle-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 12px;
    background: #f8f8f8;
    border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-quote-toggle-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    background: {{ block.settings.primary_color }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.primary_color }};
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-quote-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 24px 0;
  }

  .ai-quote-slider-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-quote-slider-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-quote-slider-input-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: #e0e0e0;
    outline: none;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
  }

  .ai-quote-slider-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: {{ block.settings.primary_color }};
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ai-quote-slider-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-moz-range-thumb {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: {{ block.settings.primary_color }};
    cursor: pointer;
    border: none;
  }

  .ai-quote-units-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 24px 0;
  }

  .ai-quote-quick-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .ai-quote-quick-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 12px;
    background: #f8f8f8;
    border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-quote-quick-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    background: {{ block.settings.primary_color }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.primary_color }};
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-quote-summary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: #f8f8f8;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .ai-quote-summary-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
  }

  .ai-quote-summary-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}.total {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .ai-quote-discount-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #10b981;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-quote-monthly-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 20px;
    background: {{ block.settings.primary_color }};
    color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .ai-quote-monthly-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .ai-quote-monthly-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-quote-sticky-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 -2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    z-index: 100;
  }

  .ai-quote-cta-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 18px;
    background: {{ block.settings.primary_color }};
    color: #ffffff;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-quote-cta-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .ai-quote-cta-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .ai-quote-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 24px;
  }

  .ai-quote-nav-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 16px;
    background: {{ block.settings.primary_color }};
    color: #ffffff;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-quote-nav-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}.secondary {
    background: #f8f8f8;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
  }

  .ai-quote-nav-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .ai-quote-disclaimer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-top: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-quote-custom-request-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  .ai-quote-custom-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
  }

  .ai-quote-custom-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .ai-quote-input-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ai-quote-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.primary_color }};
  }

  .ai-quote-select-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-quote-onboarding-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .ai-quote-confirmation-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 20px;
  }

  .ai-quote-confirmation-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    background: #10b981;
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 48px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-quote-generator-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .ai-quote-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 32px 20px;
      min-height: 350px;
    }

    .ai-quote-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .ai-quote-sticky-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 12px 16px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<quote-generator-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-quote-generator-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-quote-progress-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <span class="ai-quote-progress-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Step 1 of 5</span>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-quote-step-{{ ai_gen_id }} active" data-step="1">
    <div class="ai-quote-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h2 class="ai-quote-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Select Order Type</h2>
      <p class="ai-quote-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Choose your fulfillment service</p>
      
      <div class="ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-value="ecommerce">
        E-commerce Fulfillment
      </div>

      <div class="ai-quote-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <button class="ai-quote-nav-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-action="next">Continue</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-quote-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-step="2">
    <div class="ai-quote-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h2 class="ai-quote-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Product Details</h2>
      <p class="ai-quote-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Tell us about your product</p>
      
      <div class="ai-quote-weight-toggle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <button class="ai-quote-toggle-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} active" data-unit="oz">OZ</button>
        <button class="ai-quote-toggle-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-unit="lb">LB</button>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-quote-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-quote-slider-value-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <span class="ai-quote-weight-display-{{ ai_gen_id }}">8</span>
          <span class="ai-quote-weight-unit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">oz</span>
        </div>
        <input 
          type="range" 
          class="ai-quote-slider-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}" 
          min="1" 
          max="15.9" 
          step="0.1" 
          value="8"
          data-slider="weight"
        >
      </div>

      <div class="ai-quote-units-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <label class="ai-quote-slider-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Units per Order</label>
        <div class="ai-quote-quick-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <button class="ai-quote-quick-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} active" data-units="1">1</button>
          <button class="ai-quote-quick-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-units="2">2</button>
          <button class="ai-quote-quick-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-units="3">3</button>
          <button class="ai-quote-quick-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-units="4">4</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-quote-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <button class="ai-quote-nav-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} secondary" data-action="back">Back</button>
        <button class="ai-quote-nav-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-action="next">Continue</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-quote-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-step="3">
    <div class="ai-quote-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h2 class="ai-quote-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Destination</h2>
      <p class="ai-quote-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Shipping to United States</p>
      
      <div class="ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }} selected">
        United States (Average Rate)
      </div>

      <p class="ai-quote-disclaimer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        Average across US zones for simple, predictable pricing.
      </p>

      <div class="ai-quote-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <button class="ai-quote-nav-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} secondary" data-action="back">Back</button>
        <button class="ai-quote-nav-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-action="next">Continue</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-quote-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-step="4">
    <div class="ai-quote-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h2 class="ai-quote-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Packaging Type</h2>
      <p class="ai-quote-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Select your packaging</p>
      
      <div class="ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-packaging="poly_bag" data-cost="1.50">Poly bag</div>
      <div class="ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-packaging="bubble_poly" data-cost="1.95">Bubble poly bag</div>
      <div class="ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-packaging="small_box" data-cost="2.50">Small box (10×8×6)</div>
      <div class="ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-packaging="medium_box" data-cost="3.50">Medium box (18×12×10)</div>
      <div class="ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-packaging="oversized" data-cost="4.50">Oversized box</div>
      <div class="ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-packaging="custom" data-cost="0">Custom packaging</div>

      <div class="ai-quote-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <button class="ai-quote-nav-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} secondary" data-action="back">Back</button>
        <button class="ai-quote-nav-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-action="next">Continue</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-quote-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-step="5">
    <div class="ai-quote-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h2 class="ai-quote-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Monthly Volume</h2>
      <p class="ai-quote-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Estimated orders per month</p>
      
      <div class="ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-volume="0-499" data-discount="0">0–499</div>
      <div class="ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-volume="500-1999" data-discount="7">500–1,999</div>
      <div class="ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-volume="2000-4999" data-discount="12">2,000–4,999</div>
      <div class="ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-volume="5000-9999" data-discount="18">5,000–9,999</div>
      <div class="ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-volume="10000-24999" data-discount="25">10,000–24,999</div>
      <div class="ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-volume="25000+" data-discount="0">25,000+</div>

      <div class="ai-quote-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <button class="ai-quote-nav-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} secondary" data-action="back">Back</button>
        <button class="ai-quote-nav-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-action="calculate">Calculate Quote</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-quote-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-step="6">
    <div class="ai-quote-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h2 class="ai-quote-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Your Quote</h2>
      
      <div class="ai-quote-summary-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-quote-summary-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <span>Shipping (US Average)</span>
          <span class="ai-quote-shipping-cost-{{ ai_gen_id }}">$0.00</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-quote-summary-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <span>Pick & Pack Labor</span>
          <span class="ai-quote-labor-cost-{{ ai_gen_id }}">$0.00</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-quote-summary-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <span>Storage</span>
          <span>$25.00/mo</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-quote-summary-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-quote-discount-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="display: none;">
          <span class="ai-quote-discount-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Discount Applied</span>
          <span class="ai-quote-discount-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-quote-discount-amount-{{ ai_gen_id }}">-$0.00</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-quote-summary-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} total">
          <span>Total per Order</span>
          <span class="ai-quote-total-cost-{{ ai_gen_id }}">$0.00</span>
        </div>
      </div>


      <p class="ai-quote-disclaimer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        This quote is an estimate. Final pricing is confirmed after inventory inspection.
      </p>

      <div class="ai-quote-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <button class="ai-quote-nav-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} secondary" data-action="back">Back</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-quote-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-step="custom">
    <div class="ai-quote-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-quote-custom-request-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <h2 class="ai-quote-custom-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Request Custom Quote</h2>
        <p class="ai-quote-custom-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          Your requirements need a custom quote. Please provide your details and our team will reach out.
        </p>
        
        <input type="email" class="ai-quote-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}" placeholder="Email" required>
        <input type="text" class="ai-quote-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}" placeholder="Company Name" required>
        <input type="tel" class="ai-quote-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}" placeholder="Phone Number" required>
        
        <button class="ai-quote-nav-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-action="submit-custom">Submit Request</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-quote-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-step="onboarding">
    <div class="ai-quote-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h2 class="ai-quote-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Lock Your Quote</h2>
      <p class="ai-quote-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Complete onboarding to secure this pricing</p>
      
      <div class="ai-quote-onboarding-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <input type="email" class="ai-quote-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}" placeholder="Email" required>
        <input type="tel" class="ai-quote-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}" placeholder="Phone Number" required>
        <input type="text" class="ai-quote-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}" placeholder="Full Name" required>
        <input type="text" class="ai-quote-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}" placeholder="Company Name" required>
        
        <select class="ai-quote-select-{{ ai_gen_id }}" required>
          <option value="">Select Platform</option>
          <option value="shopify">Shopify</option>
          <option value="amazon">Amazon</option>
          <option value="walmart">Walmart</option>
          <option value="tiktok">TikTok</option>
        </select>

        <div class="ai-quote-summary-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="margin-top: 24px;">
          <div class="ai-quote-summary-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <span>One-time Onboarding Fee</span>
            <span>$150.00</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <button class="ai-quote-nav-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-action="pay" style="margin-top: 24px;">
          Lock in This Quote
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-quote-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-step="confirmation">
    <div class="ai-quote-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-quote-confirmation-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-quote-confirmation-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">✓</div>
        <h2 class="ai-quote-custom-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Quote Locked!</h2>
        <p class="ai-quote-custom-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          Your quote is locked. Our team will reach out to complete setup.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-quote-sticky-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="display: none;">
    <button class="ai-quote-cta-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}" disabled>
      Lock in This Quote
    </button>
  </div>
</quote-generator-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
(function() {
  class QuoteGenerator{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
constructor() {
  super();

  // 🔗 Google Sheets Webhook
  this.webhookUrl = 'https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwNm8Y2YQ_XHSNTiSQ65VQIiyFNmnNb9hO0tNR3qrxRpQxTQCz3AHnxcSiB1F0ZSwnD/exec';

  this.currentStep = 1;
  this.quoteData = {
    orderType: 'ecommerce',
    weightUnit: 'oz',
    weight: 8,
    units: 1,
    packaging: null,
    packagingCost: 0,
    volume: null,
    discount: 0,
    shippingCost: 0,
    laborCost: 0,
    totalPerOrder: 0
  };

      
      this.shippingRates = {
        oz: [
          { max: 4, rate: 3.50 },
          { max: 8, rate: 4.20 },
          { max: 12, rate: 4.80 },
          { max: 15.999, rate: 5.40 }
        ],
        lb: [
          { max: 1, rate: 5.80 },
          { max: 2, rate: 6.50 },
          { max: 3, rate: 7.20 },
          { max: 5, rate: 8.50 },
          { max: 10, rate: 11.00 }
        ]
      };
    }

    connectedCallback() {
      this.setupEventListeners();
      this.updateProgress();
    }

    setupEventListeners() {
      this.querySelectorAll('[data-action="next"]').forEach(btn => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', () => this.nextStep());
      });

      this.querySelectorAll('[data-action="back"]').forEach(btn => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', () => this.previousStep());
      });

      this.querySelectorAll('[data-action="calculate"]').forEach(btn => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', () => this.calculateQuote());
      });

      this.querySelectorAll('.ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}').forEach(option => {
        option.addEventListener('click', (e) => this.selectOption(e));
      });

      this.querySelectorAll('.ai-quote-toggle-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}').forEach(btn => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', (e) => this.toggleWeightUnit(e));
      });

      this.querySelectorAll('.ai-quote-quick-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}').forEach(btn => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', (e) => this.selectUnits(e));
      });

      const weightSlider = this.querySelector('[data-slider="weight"]');
      if (weightSlider) {
        weightSlider.addEventListener('input', (e) => this.updateWeight(e));
      }

      const ctaBtn = this.querySelector('.ai-quote-cta-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      if (ctaBtn) {
        ctaBtn.addEventListener('click', () => this.startOnboarding());
      }

      this.querySelectorAll('[data-action="pay"]').forEach(btn => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', (e) => this.lockQuote(e));

      });

      this.querySelectorAll('[data-action="submit-custom"]').forEach(btn => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', () => this.submitCustomRequest());
      });
    }

    selectOption(e) {
      const option = e.currentTarget;
      const step = this.currentStep;
      
      this.querySelectorAll(`[data-step="${step}"] .ai-quote-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}`).forEach(opt => {
        opt.classList.remove('selected');
      });
      
      option.classList.add('selected');

      if (option.dataset.packaging) {
        this.quoteData.packaging = option.dataset.packaging;
        this.quoteData.packagingCost = parseFloat(option.dataset.cost);
        
        if (option.dataset.packaging === 'oversized' || option.dataset.packaging === 'custom') {
          this.showCustomRequest();
          return;
        }
      }

      if (option.dataset.volume) {
        this.quoteData.volume = option.dataset.volume;
        this.quoteData.discount = parseInt(option.dataset.discount);
        
        if (option.dataset.volume === '25000+') {
          this.showCustomRequest();
          return;
        }
      }
    }

    toggleWeightUnit(e) {
      const btn = e.currentTarget;
      const unit = btn.dataset.unit;
      
      this.querySelectorAll('.ai-quote-toggle-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}').forEach(b => {
        b.classList.remove('active');
      });
      btn.classList.add('active');
      
      this.quoteData.weightUnit = unit;
      
      const slider = this.querySelector('[data-slider="weight"]');
      if (unit === 'oz') {
        slider.min = 1;
        slider.max = 15.9;
        slider.step = 0.1;
        slider.value = 8;
        this.quoteData.weight = 8;
      } else {
        slider.min = 1;
        slider.max = 10;
        slider.step = 0.1;
        slider.value = 2;
        this.quoteData.weight = 2;
      }
      
      this.updateWeightDisplay();
    }

    updateWeight(e) {
      this.quoteData.weight = parseFloat(e.target.value);
      this.updateWeightDisplay();
    }

    updateWeightDisplay() {
      const display = this.querySelector('.ai-quote-weight-display-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      const unitDisplay = this.querySelector('.ai-quote-weight-unit-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      if (display) {
        display.textContent = this.quoteData.weight.toFixed(1);
      }
      if (unitDisplay) {
        unitDisplay.textContent = this.quoteData.weightUnit;
      }
    }

    selectUnits(e) {
      const btn = e.currentTarget;
      const units = parseInt(btn.dataset.units);
      
      this.querySelectorAll('.ai-quote-quick-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}').forEach(b => {
        b.classList.remove('active');
      });
      btn.classList.add('active');
      
      this.quoteData.units = units;
    }

    calculateShipping() {
      const rates = this.shippingRates[this.quoteData.weightUnit];
      const weight = this.quoteData.weight;
      
      for (let i = 0; i < rates.length; i++) {
        if (weight <= rates[i].max) {
          return rates[i].rate;
        }
      }
      
      return 0;
    }

    calculateLabor() {
      let baseCost = this.quoteData.packagingCost;
      const extraUnits = this.quoteData.units - 1;
      
      if (extraUnits > 0) {
        const isBag = this.quoteData.packaging.includes('bag');
        const extraCost = isBag ? 0.50 : 1.00;
        baseCost += extraUnits * extraCost;
      }
      
      return baseCost;
    }

    calculateQuote() {
      this.quoteData.shippingCost = this.calculateShipping();
      const laborBeforeDiscount = this.calculateLabor();
      const discountAmount = laborBeforeDiscount * (this.quoteData.discount / 100);
      this.quoteData.laborCost = laborBeforeDiscount - discountAmount;
      
      this.quoteData.totalPerOrder = this.quoteData.shippingCost + this.quoteData.laborCost;
      
      const volumeMidpoints = {
        '0-499': 250,
        '500-1999': 1250,
        '2000-4999': 3500,
        '5000-9999': 7500,
        '10000-24999': 17500
      };
      
      const estimatedOrders = volumeMidpoints[this.quoteData.volume] || 250;
      this.quoteData.monthlyTotal = (this.quoteData.totalPerOrder * estimatedOrders) + 25;
      
      this.displayQuote();
      this.nextStep();
      this.showStickyCTA();
    }

    displayQuote() {
      const shippingEl = this.querySelector('.ai-quote-shipping-cost-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      const laborEl = this.querySelector('.ai-quote-labor-cost-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      const totalEl = this.querySelector('.ai-quote-total-cost-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      const monthlyEl = this.querySelector('.ai-quote-monthly-value-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      const discountRow = this.querySelector('.ai-quote-discount-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      const discountAmount = this.querySelector('.ai-quote-discount-amount-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      
      if (shippingEl) shippingEl.textContent = '$' + this.quoteData.shippingCost.toFixed(2);
      if (laborEl) laborEl.textContent = '$' + this.quoteData.laborCost.toFixed(2);
      if (totalEl) totalEl.textContent = '$' + this.quoteData.totalPerOrder.toFixed(2);
      if (monthlyEl) monthlyEl.textContent = '$' + Math.round(this.quoteData.monthlyTotal).toLocaleString();
      
      if (this.quoteData.discount > 0 && discountRow) {
        const laborBeforeDiscount = this.calculateLabor();
        const discount = laborBeforeDiscount * (this.quoteData.discount / 100);
        discountRow.style.display = 'flex';
        if (discountAmount) {
          discountAmount.textContent = '-$' + discount.toFixed(2) + ' (' + this.quoteData.discount + '% off labor)';
        }
      }
    }

    showStickyCTA() {
      const cta = this.querySelector('.ai-quote-sticky-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      const btn = this.querySelector('.ai-quote-cta-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      if (cta && btn) {
        cta.style.display = 'block';
        btn.disabled = false;
      }
    }

    startOnboarding() {
      this.goToStep('onboarding');
      this.hideStickyCTA();
    }

    getOnboardingData() {
      const onboardingStep = this.querySelector('[data-step="onboarding"]');

      return {
        email: onboardingStep?.querySelector('input[type="email"]')?.value?.trim() || '',
        phone_number: onboardingStep?.querySelector('input[type="tel"]')?.value?.trim() || '',
        full_name: onboardingStep?.querySelector('input[placeholder="Full Name"]')?.value?.trim() || '',
        company: onboardingStep?.querySelector('input[placeholder="Company Name"]')?.value?.trim() || '',
        platform_selected: onboardingStep?.querySelector('select')?.value || ''
      };
    }

    lockQuote(event) {
      if (event) event.preventDefault();

      const onboardingData = this.getOnboardingData();
      if (!onboardingData.full_name || !onboardingData.phone_number) {
        alert('Please enter your name and phone number to lock the quote.');
        return;
      }

      const payload = {
        ...onboardingData,
        name: onboardingData.full_name,
        phone: onboardingData.phone_number,
        orderType: this.quoteData.orderType,
        weightUnit: this.quoteData.weightUnit,
        weight: this.quoteData.weight,
        units: this.quoteData.units,
        packaging: this.quoteData.packaging,
        shipping_us_average: this.quoteData.shippingCost,
        pick_pack_labor: this.quoteData.laborCost,
        discount_percent: this.quoteData.discount,
        discount_amount: this.calculateLabor() * (this.quoteData.discount / 100),
        total_per_order: this.quoteData.totalPerOrder,
        storage_fee: 25,
        volume_band: this.quoteData.volume,
        status: 'lock_quote_clicked'
      };

      fetch(this.webhookUrl, {
        method: 'POST',
        mode: 'no-cors',
        headers: {
          'Content-Type': 'application/json'
        },
        body: JSON.stringify(payload)
      });

      this.processPayment();
    }


    hideStickyCTA() {
      const cta = this.querySelector('.ai-quote-sticky-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      if (cta) {
        cta.style.display = 'none';
      }
    }

processPayment() {
  // ✅ KEEP YOUR EXISTING SHOPIFY CHECKOUT LOGIC (unchanged)
  const form = document.createElement('form');
  form.method = 'POST';
  form.action = '/cart/add';

  const idInput = document.createElement('input');
  idInput.type = 'hidden';
  idInput.name = 'id';
  idInput.value = '43052811026475';

  const qtyInput = document.createElement('input');
  qtyInput.type = 'hidden';
  qtyInput.name = 'quantity';
  qtyInput.value = '1';

  const checkoutInput = document.createElement('input');
  checkoutInput.type = 'hidden';
  checkoutInput.name = 'checkout';
  checkoutInput.value = 'true';

  form.appendChild(idInput);
  form.appendChild(qtyInput);
  form.appendChild(checkoutInput);

  document.body.appendChild(form);
  form.submit();
}




    submitCustomRequest() {
      this.goToStep('confirmation');
    }

    showCustomRequest() {
      this.goToStep('custom');
    }

    nextStep() {
      if (this.currentStep < 6) {
        this.currentStep++;
        this.updateSteps();
        this.updateProgress();
      }
    }

    previousStep() {
      if (this.currentStep > 1) {
        this.currentStep--;
        this.updateSteps();
        this.updateProgress();
      }
    }

    goToStep(step) {
      this.querySelectorAll('.ai-quote-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}').forEach(s => {
        s.classList.remove('active');
      });
      
      const targetStep = this.querySelector(`[data-step="${step}"]`);
      if (targetStep) {
        targetStep.classList.add('active');
      }
    }

    updateSteps() {
      this.querySelectorAll('.ai-quote-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}').forEach(step => {
        step.classList.remove('active');
      });
      
      const currentStepEl = this.querySelector(`[data-step="${this.currentStep}"]`);
      if (currentStepEl) {
        currentStepEl.classList.add('active');
      }
    }

    updateProgress() {
      const progressText = this.querySelector('.ai-quote-progress-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      if (progressText && this.currentStep <= 5) {
        progressText.textContent = `Step ${this.currentStep} of 5`;
      }
    }
  }

  customElements.define('quote-generator-{{ ai_gen_id }}', QuoteGenerator{{ ai_gen_id }});
})();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Quote generator",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Colors"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "Background",
      "default": "#f8f8f8"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "primary_color",
      "label": "Primary",
      "default": "#121212"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "heading_color",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "#121212"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "#121212"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Quote generator"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
